comment0.text=\n\ The\ store\ class\ saves\ all\ the\ entered\ products\ into\ a\ primitive\ array.\n\n\ @author\ Mairead\ Meagher,\ Siobhan\ Drohan,\ Siobhan\ Roche\n\ @version\ 2.0\n
